abstract: >
  Public technical overview of FPN Hub, a PCT-pending deterministic topology
  framework for quantum processor architecture. This repository provides public
  framing and benchmark methodology notes only; protected construction logic
  and non-public benchmark materials are not disclosed. This citation refers
  to the public technical overview, not to protected implementation code or
  topology construction logic.
